{"headword":"לָמַד","parent_lexicon":"BDB Dictionary","content":{"senses":[{"definition":"<strong>vb.</strong> exercise in, learn <strong>(</strong>NH <em>id.</em>, <em>be accustomed to, learn;</em> Aramaic <span dir=\"rtl\">לְמַד</span> (rare) <em>learn;</em> Syriac <span dir=\"rtl\">ܠܡܰܕ</span> Pa. <em>accustom, combine;</em> Ettaph. <em>be taught</em>, etc.; Assyrian <em>lamâdu</em>, <em>learn</em>, Dl<sup>Prol 29</sup><strong>)</strong>;—"},{"senses":[{"definition":"Pf. 3 ms. <span dir=\"rtl\">ל׳</span> <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 26:10\" href=\"/Isaiah.26.10\">Is 26:10</a>; 1 s. <span dir=\"rtl\">לָמַדְתִּי</span> <a data-ref=\"Proverbs 30:3\" href=\"/Proverbs.30.3\">Pr 30:3</a> + 3 times Pf.; Impf. 3 ms. <span dir=\"rtl\">יִלְמַד</span> <a data-ref=\"Deuteronomy 17:19\" href=\"/Deuteronomy.17.19\">Dt 17:19</a>; 1 s. <span dir=\"rtl\">אֶלְמְדָה</span> <a data-ref=\"Psalms 119:73\" href=\"/Psalms.119.73\">ψ 119:73</a>; 3 pl. <span dir=\"rtl\">יִלְמְדוּן</span> <a data-ref=\"Deuteronomy 4:10\" href=\"/Deuteronomy.4.10\">Dt 4:10</a> + 12 times Impf.; Imv. <span dir=\"rtl\">לִמְדוּ</span> <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 1:17\" href=\"/Isaiah.1.17\">Is 1:17</a>; Inf. abs. <span dir=\"rtl\">לָמֹד</span> <a data-ref=\"Jeremiah 12:16\" href=\"/Jeremiah.12.16\">Je 12:16</a>; cstr. sf. <span dir=\"rtl\">לָמְדִי</span> <a data-ref=\"Psalms 119:7\" href=\"/Psalms.119.7\">ψ 119:7</a>; Pt. pass. cstr. <span dir=\"rtl\">לְמוּדֵי</span> <a data-ref=\"I Chronicles 5:18\" href=\"/I_Chronicles.5.18\">1 Ch 5:18</a>;—<em>learn</em> something, c. acc. <a data-ref=\"Deuteronomy 5:1\" href=\"/Deuteronomy.5.1\">Dt 5:1</a> <a data-ref=\"Psalms 119:7\" href=\"/Psalms.119.7\">ψ 119:7</a>, <a data-ref=\"Psalms 119:71\" href=\"/Psalms.119.71\">71</a>, <a data-ref=\"Psalms 119:73\" href=\"/Psalms.119.73\">73</a>; <a data-ref=\"Psalms 106:35\" href=\"/Psalms.106.35\">106:35</a> <a data-ref=\"Proverbs 30:3\" href=\"/Proverbs.30.3\">Pr 30:3</a> <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 2:4\" href=\"/Isaiah.2.4\">Is 2:4</a>; <a data-